      "text": "man put into garden in Eden, Moses 3:8, 15 (Abr. 5:8, 11). tree of life planted in Eden, Moses 3:9. tree of knowledge of good and evil in Eden, Moses 3:9 (Abr. 5:13). the Lord causes river to go out of Eden to water garden, Moses 3:10. the Lord sends man forth from Eden, Moses 4:29. cherubim and flaming sword to guard Eden, Moses 4:31. Adam and Eve hear voice from way toward Eden, Moses 5:4. Adam’s transgression in Eden forgiven, Moses 6:53. the Lord gave man his agency in Eden, Moses 7:32.",
